{"seq":2,"slug":"frequency-capping-fatigue-consent","title":"频次控制、用户疲劳与触达偏好中心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/engagement-platform-metrics/frequency-capping-fatigue-consent","wordCount":2840,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"频次控制-用户疲劳与触达偏好中心\">频次控制、用户疲劳与触达偏好中心</h1><p>一条评价激励邮件、一条「包裹已派送」推送、一张复购优惠券，共享同一个用户的收件箱与通知栏。三者由不同团队与调度器发出，用户却只当作「这个商家又在烦我」的整体来感知。<strong>频次控制（frequency capping）、疲劳度量与偏好中心，把这种分散触达收敛成一个用户级预算与同意决策</strong>——发送前必须回答三个独立问题：有没有被允许（同意）、还有没有额度（预算）、此刻值不值得（疲劳），任一不过就沉默或降级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-频次控制是-同意-预算-疲劳-的联合决策\">核心概念：频次控制是「同意 × 预算 × 疲劳」的联合决策</h2><p>把频控实现成一个通道内的计数器是这一层最典型的缺陷。计数器只回答「这个通道今天发了几条」，而真实约束是跨通道、跨团队、跨订单的注意力总量。正确的做法是把发送动作拆成一次显式判定，其状态由三部分组成：<strong>同意状态</strong>（用户是否授权该渠道该主题类别）、<strong>预算余额</strong>（滑动窗口内还剩多少额度）、<strong>疲劳分数</strong>（近期触达对边际效果的侵蚀程度）。三者正交——即使预算充足，撤回同意也须沉默；即使有同意，额度耗尽也应延迟；即使两者都允许，疲劳过高时仍应抑制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;触达意图&lt;br/&gt;intent: channel × topic&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;同意检查&lt;br/&gt;consent ledger&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;未同意 / 已撤回&quot;| Z[&quot;静默丢弃&lt;br/&gt;或降级站内归档&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;已同意&quot;| C{&quot;合并窗口&lt;br/&gt;merge window&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;滑动窗口预算&lt;br/&gt;cap remaining&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;额度耗尽&quot;| E{&quot;优先级抢占&lt;br/&gt;priority preempt&quot;}&#10;  E --&gt;|&quot;异常 / 派送失败类&quot;| F[&quot;挤占低优先级额度&lt;br/&gt;低优先级延迟&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt;|&quot;营销 / 激励类&quot;| G[&quot;延迟到下一窗口&lt;br/&gt;或丢弃&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;额度可用&quot;| H{&quot;疲劳抑制检查&lt;br/&gt;fatigue score&quot;}&#10;  H --&gt;|&quot;高于阈值&quot;| G&#10;  H --&gt;|&quot;低于阈值&quot;| I[&quot;扣减预算&lt;br/&gt;投递并写回执&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J[&quot;回写疲劳与偏好&lt;br/&gt;feedback loop&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"触达意图&lt;br/&gt;intent: channel × topic\"] --&gt; B{\"同意检查&lt;br/&gt;consent ledger\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"未同意 / 已撤回\"| Z[\"静默丢弃&lt;br/&gt;或降级站内归档\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"已同意\"| C{\"合并窗口&lt;br/&gt;merge window\"}\n  C --&gt; D{\"滑动窗口预算&lt;br/&gt;cap remaining\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"额度耗尽\"| E{\"优先级抢占&lt;br/&gt;priority preempt\"}\n  E --&gt;|\"异常 / 派送失败类\"| F[\"挤占低优先级额度&lt;br/&gt;低优先级延迟\"]\n  E --&gt;|\"营销 / 激励类\"| G[\"延迟到下一窗口&lt;br/&gt;或丢弃\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"额度可用\"| H{\"疲劳抑制检查&lt;br/&gt;fatigue score\"}\n  H --&gt;|\"高于阈值\"| G\n  H --&gt;|\"低于阈值\"| I[\"扣减预算&lt;br/&gt;投递并写回执\"]\n  I --&gt; J[\"回写疲劳与偏好&lt;br/&gt;feedback loop\"]</pre><p>这套判定与上游主动通知编排是上下游关系：编排层解决<strong>单条通知的时机与渠道</strong>（见 <a href=\"../tracking-proactive-communication/proactive-notification-orchestration\">主动通知编排与触发时机策略</a>），频控与偏好层解决<strong>跨全部触达的总额度与许可</strong>。两者边界须写清楚，否则同一份频控逻辑会在两处各实现一遍并互相矛盾。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>主动通知编排</th>\n<th>频次控制与偏好中心</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作用范围</td>\n<td>单次事件 → 单条通知</td>\n<td>用户 → 全部渠道全部触达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策变量</td>\n<td>时机、渠道、去重键</td>\n<td>同意、窗口预算、疲劳分数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态归属</td>\n<td>订单 / 事件级</td>\n<td>用户 / 账户级，跨订单跨团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败模式</td>\n<td>通知太晚、错过时窗</td>\n<td>打扰累积、退订、卸载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要指标</td>\n<td>送达率、打开率、工单下降率</td>\n<td>退订率、撤回同意率、边际 CTR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键判断：交易类与营销类必须占用互不相交的预算池。</strong> 物流状态通知是用户意识里「我要求的信息」，营销优惠是「你推销的信息」。若共用一份每日上限，用户为屏蔽促销而关闭通知权限时，会连带屏蔽掉包裹进度——平台随后还要承担「没收到派送提醒」的客服成本。工程上应在意图上打 <code>class</code> 标签并按池分开计数，这一步必须在数据结构层面做。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频次预算的三种控制维度\">频次预算的三种控制维度</h2><p>预算不是一个数字，而是三个互相正交并在不同时间尺度上生效的控制量。</p>\n<p><strong>全局窗口上限（frequency cap）<strong>是每用户每 24 小时（或 7 天）的营销类触达上限，且必须是</strong>滑动窗口</strong>而非自然日计数器。自然日计数器会在午夜重置，用户常在 23:59 与 00:01 各收到一条，感知上仍是连击。加权形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>marketing</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{u,t} = \\sum_{i:\\, t_i \\in (t-W,\\,t]} w_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}\\big[\\mathrm{class}(i) = \\text{marketing}\\big] \\;\\le\\; B_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">class</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">marketing</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为窗口长度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 条意图的打扰权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 的窗口预算。权重不可全设为 1：凌晨推送、短信渠道、无内容变化的重复内容的打扰成本显著更高，应按渠道与时段设系数。</p>\n<p>**同类事件冷却（cooldown）**约束同一订单同一语义动作在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 内只触发一次，用来吸收乱序与重复事件。**去重键（dedup key）**由「订单号 + 规范状态 + 通知类型」构造并写入幂等存储；投递系统普遍是至少一次语义，没有去重键，重试即重复打扰。三层职责递进：聚合层去重多源到达，冷却去重时间窗内重复，上限约束累计过密。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触达类别</th>\n<th>建议渠道</th>\n<th>默认窗口预算</th>\n<th>冷却</th>\n<th>是否占营销池</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>派送异常 / 失败</td>\n<td>Push + 短信兜底</td>\n<td>不受营销上限约束</td>\n<td>每单每状态 1 次</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派送预告 / 签收</td>\n<td>Push</td>\n<td>不受营销上限约束</td>\n<td>每单每状态 1 次</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装引导 / 使用教育</td>\n<td>站内 + Push</td>\n<td>新客前 7 天较高</td>\n<td>每文档 1 次</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评价激励</td>\n<td>Email + Push</td>\n<td>每单 1–2 次</td>\n<td>签收后 ≥24h</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复购优惠</td>\n<td>Email + Push + SMS</td>\n<td>每周 1–2 次</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"用户疲劳的度量与抑制窗口\">用户疲劳的度量与抑制窗口</h2><p>疲劳是可观测状态：<strong>边际 CTR 下降</strong>、<strong>退订与撤回同意率抬升</strong>、<strong>推送权限关闭率与卸载率抬升</strong>、<strong>投诉率（spam complaint）抬升</strong>。把近期触达建模为带指数衰减的记忆是最小可用形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(u,t) = \\sum_{i} w_i \\, e^{-\\lambda (t - t_i)}, \\qquad \\tau = \\tfrac{1}{\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是半衰窗口，反映打扰记忆的消退速度——促销类以周计，服务类以天计。疲劳分数有两种用法：<strong>硬抑制</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(u,t) \\ge \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 时进入冷却；或<strong>软缩放</strong>，把预算按疲劳降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_u = B_0 \\cdot \\max\\!\\big(0,\\, 1 - F/\\theta\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>。软缩放通常更优，避免了「大促季节把全体用户压到零触达」的悬崖效应。</p>\n<p>疲劳也来自<strong>内容无变化</strong>：广告界「有效频次（3+ 次曝光）」的结论不能搬到购后场景，购后内容同质度更高、交易动机已弱，边际增量在第二、三次触达后衰减更快。</p>\n<p><strong>一个容易被忽略的工程约束：打开率在 Apple Mail Privacy Protection（iOS 15，2021 起）下已被系统预取破坏，不再可信。</strong> 依赖它的邮件疲劳与频控系统会得到系统性偏高的分母与失真的衰减曲线；应改用点击与投诉作为主信号，并把邮件与推送的疲劳分数分开维护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触达偏好中心与同意状态机\">触达偏好中心与同意状态机</h2><p>偏好中心（preference center）是用户可见的 <code>渠道 × 主题类别</code> 矩阵，把抽象同意落到逐格切换的控制面上。每个单元对应一个同意状态，状态机为 <code>unknown → granted → withdrawn</code>（可恢复），每次迁移记录时间戳、来源渠道（Web / App / 客服 / 退订链接 / 全局隐私信号）与政策版本。跨境场景须逐法域映射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域 / 规则</th>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>关键要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GDPR 第 7 条、第 21(1) 条</td>\n<td>opt-in</td>\n<td>同意须自由给出、具体、知情、可随时撤回；对直邮的反对权生效后必须停止，不得要求理由或再次确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ePrivacy 指令 2002/58/EC 第 13 条</td>\n<td>opt-in</td>\n<td>电子营销需事前同意；既有客户在同一法人内同类产品有软 opt-in 例外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国 TCPA</td>\n<td>opt-in</td>\n<td>营销短信与自动呼叫需事前书面同意；FCC 2023 年「逐条同意」规则于 2025 年 1 月被第十一巡回法院撤销（<em>Insurance Marketing Coalition v. FCC</em>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国 CAN-SPAM</td>\n<td>opt-out</td>\n<td>需有效退订机制、真实主题与发件人、实体邮寄地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CCPA / CPRA</td>\n<td>opt-out</td>\n<td>出售与共享的选择退出；CPRA 下必须尊重 Global Privacy Control 信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加拿大 CASL</td>\n<td>opt-in</td>\n<td>明示或默示同意，退订须在 10 个工作日内生效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>发送侧亦有平台强制要求：<strong>Google 与 Yahoo 自 2024 年 2 月起对日均发信 5000+ 的批量发送方要求支持一键退订（RFC 8058 的 <code>List-Unsubscribe-Post</code> 头），并把垃圾投诉率阈值设在 0.3% 以下</strong>（Google Postmaster / RFC 8058）。退订体验由此成为可被降级的硬门：投诉率越线会限制整域投递，连带影响交易类邮件送达。</p>\n<p>工程上的关键是把同意做成<strong>单一事实源</strong>：一份带版本与时间戳的 consent ledger，所有通道 adapter 发送前查询它，撤回事件经事件总线扇出到邮件、推送、短信、CRM 与广告受众同步（链路模式见 <a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine\">购后事件总线与旅程状态机</a>）。<strong>撤回必须是同步可见的破坏性操作</strong>：任何异步复制窗口都会造成撤回后仍收到消息，这正是投诉与监管风险的主要来源。测量侧须接入 Google Consent Mode v2（2024 年 3 月起为欧洲经济区广告投放所必需），否则同意状态与转化归因会在两个系统里不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-用-holdout-与护栏指标验证频控效果\">度量：用 holdout 与护栏指标验证频控效果</h2><p>频控不是「越少越好」，过度抑制会直接损失复购 GMV，因此须用**长期对照（contact-strategy holdout）**判断策略优劣：随机留出一部分用户完全不参与该类触达，测量增量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Lift per send</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>treat</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mtext>holdout</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Lift per send} = \\frac{1}{|S|}\\sum_{u \\in S}\\frac{Y_{u,\\text{treat}} - \\overline{Y}_{\\text{holdout}}}{n_u}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lift per send</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.882em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">holdout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 是归因后的转化或留存。增量为正才说明该触达值得占用预算，这是判断「某类触达是否应整体下线」的唯一可靠依据。单次 A/B 在此处易失真：同一用户被多通道反复触及会产生干扰（SUTVA 违背），应改用 switchback 或分批错峰的渐进放量。</p>\n<p>护栏指标是频控的上限约束，任何一个越线都应触发策略回滚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>参考红线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>营销类退订率</td>\n<td>unsubscribe / delivered</td>\n<td>环比升 &gt; 20% 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤回同意率 / 权限关闭率</td>\n<td>withdrawal、permission revoke / 活跃用户</td>\n<td>按渠道分桶监控，关联卸载率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>垃圾投诉率</td>\n<td>complaint / delivered</td>\n<td>须低于 0.3%（Google / Yahoo 阈值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边际 CTR</td>\n<td>每增加一条触达的 CTR 增量</td>\n<td>连续为负即减预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周触达分布</td>\n<td>p50 / p95 每用户周触达数</td>\n<td>p95 不得长期贴上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净增量</td>\n<td>holdout 差值</td>\n<td>为负即该策略无效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>指标口径本身需要一个<strong>统一触达事件表</strong>：每次投递落到同一张带 <code>user_id / channel / topic / class / campaign / consent_state_at_send / fatigue_score_at_send</code> 的事实表。没有它，退订率分母、疲劳分数输入、holdout 样本会各算一套，护栏指标失去可解释性——它与身份解析（见 <a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/journey-identity-resolution-profile\">旅程身份解析与用户画像</a>）必须共用同一套 <code>user_id</code> 才能跨设备合并触达历史。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>频次控制是「同意 × 预算 × 疲劳」的三段联合判定，不是通道内计数器；跨渠道、跨团队共享同一用户注意力总量。</li>\n<li>预算用滑动窗口而非自然日计数器，控制维度是窗口上限、同类冷却、去重键三者递进叠加；交易类与营销类必须占互不相交的预算池。</li>\n<li>疲劳用指数衰减记忆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(u,t)=\\sum_i w_i e^{-\\lambda(t-t_i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1877em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 建模，优先做预算软缩放而非硬阈值抑制；主信号是点击、退订、投诉、权限变更（打开率在 Apple MPP 下不可信）。</li>\n<li>同意做成带版本与时间戳的单一事实源，撤回必须同步破坏性生效；法域映射覆盖 GDPR、ePrivacy、TCPA、CAN-SPAM、CCPA/CPRA、CASL。一键退订（RFC 8058）与投诉率阈值（Google / Yahoo 0.3%）是可被平台强制执行的硬门。</li>\n<li>效果判定用长期 holdout 的每发送增量，配合退订率、投诉率、边际 CTR 等护栏指标，任一越线即回滚。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"频次控制、用户疲劳与触达偏好中心","id":"频次控制-用户疲劳与触达偏好中心"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：频次控制是「同意 × 预算 × 疲劳」的联合决策","id":"核心概念-频次控制是-同意-预算-疲劳-的联合决策"},{"level":2,"text":"频次预算的三种控制维度","id":"频次预算的三种控制维度"},{"level":2,"text":"用户疲劳的度量与抑制窗口","id":"用户疲劳的度量与抑制窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"触达偏好中心与同意状态机","id":"触达偏好中心与同意状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"度量：用 holdout 与护栏指标验证频控效果","id":"度量-用-holdout-与护栏指标验证频控效果"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"互动平台架构与消息通道集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/engagement-platform-metrics/engagement-platform-architecture"},"next":{"title":"互动效果度量与实验归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/engagement-platform-metrics/engagement-metrics-experiment-attribution"}}